<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared with Friday's close, Fresh loins were mostly $2.00 lower; butts were firm in a light test; skinned hams 17-20 lbs held steady, 20-26 lbs ranged steady to $1.00 lower; seedless bellies steady to $1.00 higher; lean trimmings steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Trading was slow, with light to moderate demand and offerings.</p>
